            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 23:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“No bastard shall enter the assembly of the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "; even to the tenth generation none of his descendants shall enter the assembly of the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 23:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 23:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“No Ammonite or Moabite shall enter the assembly of the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "; even to the tenth generation none belonging to them shall enter the assembly of the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " for ever; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 23:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "because they did not meet you with bread and with water on the way, when you came forth out of Egypt, and because they hired against you Balaam the son of Beor from Pethor of Mesopotamia, to curse you. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 23:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nevertheless the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " your God would not hearken to Balaam; but the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " your God turned the curse into a blessing for you, because the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " your God loved you. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 23:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "You shall not seek their peace or their prosperity all your days for ever.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 23:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 23:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“You shall not abhor an Edomite, for he is your brother; you shall not abhor an Egyptian, because you were a sojourner in his land. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 23:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The children of the third generation that are born to them may enter the assembly of the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 23:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 23:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“When you go forth against your enemies and are in camp, then you shall keep yourself from every evil thing.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 23:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 23:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“If there is among you any man who is not clean by reason of what chances to him by night, then he shall go outside the camp, he shall not come within the camp; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 23:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "but when evening comes on, he shall bathe himself in water, and when the sun is down, he may come within the camp.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 23:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 23:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“You shall have a place outside the camp and you shall go out to it; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 23:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and you shall have a stick with your weapons; and when you sit down outside, you shall dig a hole with it, and turn back and cover up your excrement. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 23:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Because the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " your God walks in the midst of your camp, to save you and to give up your enemies before you, therefore your camp must be holy, that he may not see anything indecent among you, and turn away from you.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 23:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 23:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“You shall not give up to his master a slave who has escaped from his master to you; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 23:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "he shall dwell with you, in your midst, in the place which he shall choose within one of your towns, where it pleases him best; you shall not oppress him.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 23:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 23:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“There shall be no cult prostitute of the daughters of Israel, neither shall there be a cult prostitute of the sons of Israel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 23:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "You shall not bring the hire of a harlot, or the wages of a dog,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23.18",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Or",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "sodomite",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " into the house of the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " your God in payment for any vow; for both of these are an abomination to the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " your God.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
