        },
        {
          "text": " “When you make a vow to the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " your God, you shall not be slack to pay it; for the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " your God will surely require it of you, and it would be sin in you. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.23.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.23.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
